{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49736","headline":"临江仙 二 · 孙光宪","name":"临江仙 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮雨凄凄深院闭，灯前凝坐初更。\n玉钗低压鬓云横，半垂罗幕，相映烛光明。\n终是有心投汉佩，低头但理秦筝。\n燕双鸾偶不胜情，只愁明发，将逐楚云行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙光宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}